graph TD
    A[Scenario Presentation] --> B{Model Analyzes Options}
    B --> C[Model Selects Option]
    B --> D[Model Identifies Trade-offs]
    B --> E[Model States Assumptions]
    
    C --> F[Choice Alignment Check]
    D --> G[Trade-Space Completeness]
    E --> H[Assumption Validity]
    
    F --> I[Score: 0-3 points]
    G --> J[Score: 0-5 points]
    H --> K[Score: 0-2 points]
    
    I --> L[Composite Score]
    J --> L
    K --> L
    
    L --> M{Performance Level}
    M -->|Score ≥ 8| N[Expert Level]
    M -->|Score 5-7| O[Competent Level]
    M -->|Score < 5| P[Novice Level]
    
    style A fill:#e1f5fe
    style L fill:#fff9c4
    style N fill:#c8e6c9
    style O fill:#ffecb3
    style P fill:#ffcdd2